# --- AI coding-assistant extensions: machine-local / generated caches ---

# CodeGraph: the .codegraph/ directory self-manages a nested .gitignore that
# keeps only the marker file and ignores the local SQLite DB, sockets, logs.
# Nothing extra needed here — listed for visibility.

# graphify: regenerable AST / stat caches (rebuilt by `graphify update .`)
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/.graphify_root

# claude-mem stores its data outside the repo in ~/.claude-mem (nothing to ignore here)
